		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Once captain of whatever accursed ship sunk beneath the waves, now reborn unto death as undead champion.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13 (chainmail), <strong>HP</strong> 16, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 greataxe +3 (1d10 + sicken) or fog cloud, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fog Cloud</strong>. For 1d4 rounds, fog fills a near-sized cube centered on draugr. It spreads around corners. Mortal creatures inside the cloud are blinded.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sicken</strong>. CON 12+ or sickened for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
